    "title": "Privacy-preserving for user-uploaded images and text in Vision–Language Models",
    "authors": "Zixiang Liu, Chi Chen, Shuguang Yuan, Weilong Huang, Xiaojie Zhu, Peizhuo Lv",
    "journal": "Computers & Security",
