    "title": "MARSNet: A convolutional attention residual shrinkage network for RNA-protein binding site prediction",
    "authors": "Wei Wang, Chengyu Xing, Zhenxi Sun, Xianfang Wang, Guangsheng Wu, Yun Zhou",
