    "title": "Verifiable Encrypted Timed Signature Scheme and Its Application in Blockchains",
    "authors": "Yuan Li, Junzuo Lai, Yi Liu, Liang Zhang, Haiyan Wang, Ke Ma, Jiheng Zhang",
