    "title": "Policy optimization for CMDPs with bandit feedback: Best-of-both-worlds and beyond",
    "authors": "Francesco Emanuele Stradi, Anna Lunghi, Matteo Castiglioni, Alberto Marchesi, Nicola Gatti",
    "journal": "Artificial Intelligence",
    "year": "2026",
    "published": "2026-09-01（2026-07-19 在线发布）",
    "contentState": "complete",
