    "title": "CM-ARM: Collaborative Model for Privacy-Preserving Association Rule Mining",
    "authors": "Xiyu Jiang, Yao-Tung Tsou, Sy-Yen Kuo, Yennun Huang",
    "journal": "IEEE Transactions on Dependable and Secure Computing",
