    "authors": "Yixuan Song, Chundong Wang, Xumeng Wang, Yongxin Zhao, Zheli Liu, Qingbo Hao, Hao Lin, Yuhan Tian",
    "journal": "IEEE Transactions on Dependable and Secure Computing",
    "year": "2026",
